"computer."
msgstr "尚未安装国际象棋引擎。您将无法与电脑对战。"

#. Game status on White's turn when in check
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:795
msgid "White is in Check"
msgstr "白方被将"

#. Game status on Black's turn when in check
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:798
msgid "Black is in Check"
msgstr "黑方被将"

#. Game status on White's turn if White is human
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:804
msgid "White to Move"
msgstr "白方执子"

#. Game status on White's turn if White is a computer
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:807
msgid "White is Thinking…"
msgstr "白方正在思索中……"

#. Game status on Black's turn if Black is human
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:813
msgid "Black to Move"
msgstr "黑方执子"

#. Game status on Black's turn if Black is a computer
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:816
msgid "Black is Thinking…"
msgstr "黑方正在思索中……"

#. Game status when Black captures White's pawn en passant
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:827
msgid ""
"Black captured White's pawn <span font_style='italic'>en passant</span>."
msgstr "黑兵吃掉<span font_style='italic'>过路</span>白兵。"

#. Game status when White captures Black's pawn en passant
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:830
msgid ""
"White captured Black's pawn <span font_style='italic'>en passant</span>."
msgstr "白兵吃掉<span font_style='italic'>过路</span>黑兵。"

#. Game status when the white player wins
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:848
msgid "White Wins"
msgstr "白方获胜"

#. Game status when the black player wins
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:853
msgid "Black Wins"
msgstr "黑方获胜"

#. Game status when the game is drawn
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:858
msgid "Game is Drawn"
msgstr "和棋"

#. Game status when something goes wrong with the engine.
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:863
msgid "Oops!"
msgstr "糟糕！"

#. Game status when Black is checkmated
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:876
msgid "Black is in check and cannot move."
msgstr "黑方正被将军且无子可走。"

#. Game status when White is checkmated
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:879
msgid "White is in check and cannot move."
msgstr "白方正被将军且无子可走。"

#. Game status when the game terminates due to a stalemate
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:885
msgid "Player cannot move."
msgstr "玩家无子可走。"

#. Game status when the game is drawn due to the fifty move rule
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:889
msgid "No piece was taken or pawn moved in fifty moves."
msgstr "过去十五步内没有子被吃且兵没有移动。"

#. Game status when the game is drawn due to the 75 move rule
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:893
msgid "No piece was taken or pawn moved in 75 moves."
msgstr "过去 75 步内没有子被吃且兵没有移动。"

#. Game status when the game ends due to Black's clock stopping
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:898
msgid "Black has run out of time."
msgstr "黑方超时。"

#. Game status when the game ends due to White's clock stopping
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:901
msgid "White has run out of time."
msgstr "白方超时。"

#. Game status when the game is drawn due to the three-fold-repetition rule
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:907
msgid "The same board state has occurred three times."
msgstr "对局中同一局面已出现三次。"

#. Game status when the game is drawn due to the five-fold-repetition rule
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:911
msgid "The same board state has occurred five times."
msgstr "同一局面已出现五次。"

#. Game status when the game is drawn due to the insufficient material rule
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:915
msgid "Neither player can checkmate."
msgstr "双方都无法将死对方。"

#. Game status when the game ends due to the black player resigning
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:920
msgid "Black has resigned."
msgstr "黑方已认输。"

#. Game status when the game ends due to the white player resigning
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:923
msgid "White has resigned."
msgstr "白方已认输。"

#. Game status when a game is abandoned
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:929
msgid "The game has been abandoned."
msgstr "已放弃游戏。"

#. Game status when the game ends due to a player dying during the game.
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:934
msgid "The game log says a player died!"
msgstr "游戏日志显示有一名玩家已经死了！"

#. Game status when something goes wrong with the engine.
#: src/gnome-chess.vala:939
msgid "The computer player is confused. The game cannot continue."
msgstr "计算机棋手已经陷入混乱。游戏无法继续下去了。"

